    "scale_info": {
      "name": "Reflective Functioning Questionnaire – 26 items",
      "code": "RFQ-26",
      "abbreviation": "RFQ-26",
      "description": "26-item RFQ form. 7-point. NOTE: subscale scoring not yet sourced — a placeholder uncoded mean is provided pending the validated RFQ-26 scoring.",
      "citation": "Reflective Functioning Questionnaire (RFQ-54). Supplemental to a PLoS ONE open-access (CC BY 4.0) article (https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0259030); see also Fonagy et al. (2016), PLoS ONE 11(7): e0158678.",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0",
      "license_explanation": "RFQ items are published in open-access PLoS ONE articles under CC BY 4.0 and reproduced here with attribution: the RFQ validity study with supplemental item materials (https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0259030, PLOS figshare 'RFQ54 with self and other subscales') and the RFQ-8 short form (Fonagy et al., 2016, PLoS ONE 11(7): e0158678).",
      "license_url": "https://journals.plos.org/plosone/article?id=10.1371/journal.pone.0259030",
      "url": "https://www.ucl.ac.uk/psychoanalysis/research/reflective-functioning-questionnaire-rfq",
      "domain": "Clinical",
      "version": "1.0"
    },
    "implementation": {
      "author": "Shane T. Mueller",
      "organization": "OpenScales Project",
      "date": "2026-06-17",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/",
      "notes": "26-item RFQ. EN via mapping to the 54; KO from UCL Korean RFQ (26). SCORING PENDING: the validated RFQ-26 certainty/uncertainty (or self/other) assignment is not in hand — placeholder uncoded mean; VERIFY against PLoS pone.0259030 supplemental. CC BY via PLoS — now in openscales/. SCORING STATUS (investigated 2026-06-17): no citable source found for the validated RFQ-26 subscale scoring (not in pone.0259030 / pone.0282000 / UCL materials). Placeholder uncoded mean retained pending source."
    },
